/.omc/
# Runtime state can also land in a *nested* .omc/ when a tool resolves its
# project root to a subdirectory -- it has appeared inside src/main/java/,
# where it pollutes the Java source tree. Ignored recursively, except
# .omc/skills/ which is the intentional committable exception.
**/.omc/state/
**/.omc/logs/
**/.omc/plans/
**/.omc/research/
**/.omc/artifacts/
**/.omc/handoffs/
